  "description": "FRAMESET\n\nFrame Steel, TIG welded with 2x rear dropout eyelets\n\nSizes 50cm, 54cm, 58cm\n\nFork Steel, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm) Threaded for Quill, TIG welded, 2x eyelets: 1/dropout + 1/mid-blade\n\nWHEELSET\n\nRims Alloy double-wall, 700C x 36H x 13G\n\nSpokes 13G UCP w/brass nipples, Black\n\nTires 700 x 45C, S/V\n\nEXTRAS\n\nKickstand Center mount, adjustable, steel\n\nRear Carrier Battery holder & carrier, steel\n\nBell Alloy\n\nLight(s) Front (4x AAA) + Rear (2x AA), batteries included\n\nFenders Steel fenders w/alloy stays\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur Shimano Tourney 7S, RD-TX35-SGS\n\nShifters Shimano Tourney Thumb Shifter (push/pull) 7S, SL-TX50-7R\n\nCrankset Alloy 3-piece 170mm x 42T, alum arms, steel chainring\n\nChain KMC Z-series 1/2 x 3/32\"\n\nBB Steel sealed cartridge, 68 x 124.5mm\n\nFreewheel/Cog Shimano 7-speed 14-28\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nHeadset Threaded, steel, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm)\n\nBrakes JAX Mechanical disc Front & Rear, 160mm\n\nHandlebars Alloy low-rise, 610mmW x 40mm rise\n\nGrips Retrospec Comfort\n\nStem Alloy quill, single-bolt clamp\n\nSaddle Retrospec Comfort w/springs\n\nSeatpost Alloy w/integrated micro-adjust clamp, 28.6 x 300mm\n\nSeatpost Clamp Alloy QR\n\nPedals High Impact, Reinforced Nylon Resin Platform, 9/16\"\n\nE-POWER SYSTEM\n\n36V/350W Motor Brushless rear hub motor, 9-pin connector. MXUS\n\n36V/350W Battery Li-ion + Charger w/US plug, w/power level display. Tianjin Xianzhong New Energy Technology Co., Ltd\n\n48V/500W Motor Brushless rear hub motor, 9-pin connector, MXUS\n\n48V/500W Battery Li-ion + Charger w/US plug, w/power level display. Tianjin Xianzhong New Energy Technology Co., Ltd\n\nDrive Mode, Display PAS/throttle, speed sensor, LED handlebar-mount display panel w/3 assistance levels, w/Start-Aid 6kph (~4mph)\n\nController Yelchm Technology\n\nCharge Time (empty to full) 10.4Ah battery (350 & 500W): 5-6 hours\n\n*Due to different screen resolutions, colors may vary.",
